       "text": "The Ashfell Slide affected the mining district of Dreth from March 14, 2026, centred on Withel and Cranmoor.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "A bench failure in the Corvane workings damaged the lower road and disrupted service on the upper bench and at the mine.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "About 60 households were evacuated from Withel terraces and 60 households were displaced from Cranmoor.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "Yelverton Minerals restored the lower road and revised its policy alongside an independent panel.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
